          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Layla is the **first of the Igigi born on Earth**, delivered within the breeding facilities of Landing Site Gamma.",
      "inferred": {
        "thought": [
          {
            "subject": "unknown",
            "confidence": 0.6
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "To the Anunnaki, she is merely a **\"high-utility biological yield\"** and a unit of \"workforce optimization\" scheduled according to compatibility matrices.",
      "inferred": {
        "thought": [
          {
            "subject": "unknown",
            "confidence": 0.6
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "To her mother and the Igigi community, she is a named individual—carrying a word from a language spoken before their enslavement—representing a **secret continuity of their culture**.",
      "inferred": {
        "thought": [
          {
            "subject": "unknown",
            "confidence": 0.6
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "type": "internal_monologue",
      "text": "\"*Nature*\"",
      "inferred": {
        "thought": [
          {
            "subject": "unknown",
            "confidence": 0.6
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She is an Igigi newborn, possessing the **elongated form** and bio-luminescent potential of her species.",
      "inferred": {
        "thought": [
          {
            "subject": "unknown",
            "confidence": 0.6
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "While she is currently a vulnerable infant, she is the biological manifestation of the Igigi's survival on a new world, distinguished by being **born in the \"darkness\" of the occupation** yet carrying the hope of a future \"dawn\".",
      "inferred": {
        "thought": [
          {
            "subject": "unknown",
            "confidence": 0.6
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "type": "internal_monologue",
      "text": "\"*Drives*\"",
      "inferred": {
        "thought": [
          {
            "subject": "unknown",
            "confidence": 0.6
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "While her personal drives are currently embryonic, she serves as the **primary motivation** for those around her.",
      "inferred": {
        "thought": [
          {
            "subject": "unknown",
            "confidence": 0.6
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 17,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She represents the drive for **transgenerational survival**; her existence motivates Ishara to protect her with \"every calculation her mathematical mind could generate\" and pushes Pazuzu to calculate the probabilities of a \"branch where slavery ends\".",
      "inferred": {
        "thought": [
          {
            "subject": "unknown",
            "confidence": 0.6
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 18,
      "type": "blank"
    },
    {
      "line": 19,
      "type": "internal_monologue",
      "text": "\"*Limits*\"",
      "inferred": {
        "thought": [
          {
            "subject": "unknown",
            "confidence": 0.6
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 20,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "Layla is physically helpless and entirely **dependent on a system designed to exploit her**.",
      "inferred": {
        "thought": [
          {
            "subject": "unknown",
            "confidence": 0.6
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 21,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "She is subject to \"population assessment\" by the Anunnaki and is born into a state of **genetically-mandated obedience**, where her very consciousness is intended to be bypassed by Overseer commands as she matures.",
      "inferred": {
        "thought": [
          {
            "subject": "unknown",
            "confidence": 0.6
          }
