          {
            "label": "creation",
            "confidence": 0.9
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 26,
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "If she were removed, the primary emotional anchor for the Igigi’s burgeoning thoughts of rebellion would be lost."
